{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#feature-create-edit","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 的功能「create-edit」：创建和编辑便签：在侧边栏便签页打开编辑框，填写标题与正文、选择八种颜色之一并保存；卡片显示便签内容和更新时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:812-829","client.js:869-923"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#feature-bulk-delete","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 的功能「bulk-delete」：批量删除便签：勾选一张或多张卡片后使用删除按钮，所选便签会从列表中移除；未选择便签时删除按钮不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:840-843","client.js:1159-1165"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#feature-reminders","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 的功能「reminders」：设置日程提醒：编辑便签时可选择每天、每周（指定星期）、每月或单次提醒，并设定时间；到点后便签进入提醒状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:936-1054","client.js:540-560"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#feature-acknowledge","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 的功能「acknowledge」：查看并停止提醒：提醒中的卡片提供单条停止操作；未显示在可视区域的提醒可从底部提示栏查看，也可一次停止全部。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:845-858","client.js:1127-1143"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#feature-local-persistence","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 的功能「local-persistence」：本地保存便签：便签及提醒状态序列化到浏览器 localStorage，重新载入后读取并规范化可用记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:349-367","client.js:497-529"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#caveat-storage","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Colorful Notes 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存便签；清除站点数据或更换浏览器后，原有便签不会随插件迁移。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:9-10","client.js:349-367"]}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-1","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · colorful-notes-dsh：多彩便签 —— DeepSeek Harness 侧边栏的彩色便签板，支持每天、每周、每月和单次提醒。\n\nColorful sticky notes for the DeepSeek Harness sidebar, with daily, weekly, monthly and one-time reminders.","source":"extracted","section":"colorful-notes-dsh"}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-2","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · 功能：- 侧边栏「多彩便签」入口，点击打开中部便签页。\n- 添加、编辑、批量删除便签；每条便签有标题、正文和 8 种颜色之一。\n- 卡片显示标题、正文前 4 行和更新时间；点击卡片或铅笔图标可再次编辑。\n- 删除需先勾选至少一条便签，删除按钮才会变为可用。\n- **提醒**：每天、每周（可多选星期几）、每月（29/30/31 号遇短月顺延到当月最后一天）、单次（指定日期与时间）。\n- 到点后侧边栏图标出现闪烁并震动的闹铃徽标；正在提醒的便签卡片按自身颜色霓虹呼吸。\n- 提醒中的便签不在可视区域内时，页面底部按所有提醒便签的颜色显示多色霓虹光带，并提供「查看」与「全部停止」。\n- 每条提醒中的便签都有「停止提醒」按钮；停止后该次提醒不再触发，下一次到点仍会提醒。\n- 中英文界面；便签数据保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-3","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · 安装：从 GitHub 安装：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile <你的 profile 名> add github:RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh\n```\n\n安装后侧边栏会出现便签图标，点击即可打开「多彩便签」。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-4","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · 使用：1. 点击「添加便笺」，填写标题和内容并选择颜色。\n2. 需要提醒时，在编辑对话框的「提醒」区域选择类型并设置时间。\n3. 到达提醒时间后，侧边栏图标和便签页会给出提示；点便签上的「停止提醒」或底部「全部停止」结束本次提醒。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-5","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · 数据：便签保存在当前浏览器 localStorage 的 `dsh.colorful-notes.v1` 键下，不会上传服务器；清理站点数据或换浏览器会丢失。","source":"extracted","section":"数据"}
{"unit_id":"RockChen87__colorful-notes-dsh#readme-6","repo":"RockChen87/colorful-notes-dsh","commit":"214cb427ec582077fbee042452df5bb1d65a80d3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"colorful-notes-dsh README · 开发：无需构建步骤：`client.js` 是浏览器端模块，由 `package.json` 的 `./client` 导出；`index.js` 是 Host 半，仅用于让 bundle 行生效。","source":"extracted","section":"开发"}
